' stack: rust
' Components of Stellar: one per crate of the Cargo workspace, one arrow per allowed dependency (normal and build, not dev).
' A <<restricted>> crate may depend only on the external crates drawn (<<external>>); the others are free.
' Checked by .github/scripts/architecture.py. Rewrite the crates and arrows from the code: python3 .github/scripts/architecture.py --write, then review.
' exclude: 
@startuml
[stellar-app]
[stellar-application] <<restricted>>
[stellar-domain] <<restricted>>
[stellar-engine-cpu]
[stellar-engine-gpu]
[stellar-persistence]
[glam] <<external>>
[rand] <<external>>
[rand_pcg] <<external>>
[rayon] <<external>>
[serde] <<external>>
[thiserror] <<external>>
[stellar-app] --> [stellar-application]
[stellar-app] --> [stellar-domain]
[stellar-app] --> [stellar-engine-cpu]
[stellar-app] --> [stellar-engine-gpu]
[stellar-app] --> [stellar-persistence]
[stellar-application] --> [rand]
[stellar-application] --> [rand_pcg]
[stellar-application] --> [rayon]
[stellar-application] --> [serde]
[stellar-application] --> [stellar-domain]
[stellar-application] --> [thiserror]
[stellar-domain] --> [glam]
[stellar-domain] --> [serde]
[stellar-engine-cpu] --> [stellar-domain]
[stellar-engine-gpu] --> [stellar-domain]
[stellar-persistence] --> [stellar-application]
[stellar-persistence] --> [stellar-domain]
@enduml
